    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083360/extras/c828e600b809c49b1c0a38c3eeba07da.poster.avif?t=1749060710\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083360/extras/c828e600b809c49b1c0a38c3eeba07da.webm?t=1749060710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083360/extras/c828e600b809c49b1c0a38c3eeba07da.mp4?t=1749060710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>In In this intergalactic roguelike, a mysterious wormhole has turned the Earth and its inhabitants into jigsaw puzzles! Play as Frogus, the last surviving frog, and traverse floating platforms in space while battling enemies and collecting puzzle pieces. Save your fellow frogs and unlock the secret of the multicolored vortex to rebuild the Earth!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083360/extras/6c91ae8fe8f64e8ac8d7d67409c1cc65.poster.avif?t=1749060710\" width=630 height=186 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083360/extras/6c91ae8fe8f64e8ac8d7d67409c1cc65.webm?t=1749060710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083360/extras/6c91ae8fe8f64e8ac8d7d67409c1cc65.mp4?t=1749060710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\ud83d\udc38Explore levels, alien enemies, and completely randomly generated environments with each playthrough. Each adventure is unique, with surprises in store for Frogus with every leap into space.\ud83c\udf20 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083360/extras/4e2134cc73191fbc1d11f650360d06e4.poster.avif?t=1749060710\" width=630 height=186 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083360/extras/4e2134cc73191fbc1d11f650360d06e4.webm?t=1749060710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083360/extras/4e2134cc73191fbc1d11f650360d06e4.mp4?t=1749060710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u2728Upgrade your cards as you level up, and unlock new ones after each successful level, to diversify your powers and crush enemies!\u2728</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083360/extras/8ec9dfbadddbe3bc419f1a1067f1606a.poster.avif?t=1749060710\" width=630 height=186 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083360/extras/8ec9dfbadddbe3bc419f1a1067f1606a.webm?t=1749060710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083360/extras/8ec9dfbadddbe3bc419f1a1067f1606a.mp4?t=1749060710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\ud83d\udc4aEpic space combat! Defend Frogus against alien invaders! \ud83d\udc7d </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083360/extras/045681d4069a05a74a394898d700698f.avif?t=1749060710\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >________________________________________________________________________________________________________</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083360/extras/de00594a3877e8582d3700c6db9c1920.avif?t=1749060710\" width=631 height=94 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083360/extras/c828e600b809c49b1c0a38c3eeba07da.poster.avif?t=1749060710\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083360/extras/c828e600b809c49b1c0a38c3eeba07da.webm?t=1749060710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083360/extras/c828e600b809c49b1c0a38c3eeba07da.mp4?t=1749060710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>In In this intergalactic roguelike, a mysterious wormhole has turned the Earth and its inhabitants into jigsaw puzzles! Play as Frogus, the last surviving frog, and traverse floating platforms in space while battling enemies and collecting puzzle pieces. Save your fellow frogs and unlock the secret of the multicolored vortex to rebuild the Earth!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083360/extras/6c91ae8fe8f64e8ac8d7d67409c1cc65.poster.avif?t=1749060710\" width=630 height=186 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083360/extras/6c91ae8fe8f64e8ac8d7d67409c1cc65.webm?t=1749060710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083360/extras/6c91ae8fe8f64e8ac8d7d67409c1cc65.mp4?t=1749060710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\ud83d\udc38Explore levels, alien enemies, and completely randomly generated environments with each playthrough. Each adventure is unique, with surprises in store for Frogus with every leap into space.\ud83c\udf20 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083360/extras/4e2134cc73191fbc1d11f650360d06e4.poster.avif?t=1749060710\" width=630 height=186 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083360/extras/4e2134cc73191fbc1d11f650360d06e4.webm?t=1749060710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083360/extras/4e2134cc73191fbc1d11f650360d06e4.mp4?t=1749060710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u2728Upgrade your cards as you level up, and unlock new ones after each successful level, to diversify your powers and crush enemies!\u2728</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083360/extras/8ec9dfbadddbe3bc419f1a1067f1606a.poster.avif?t=1749060710\" width=630 height=186 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083360/extras/8ec9dfbadddbe3bc419f1a1067f1606a.webm?t=1749060710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083360/extras/8ec9dfbadddbe3bc419f1a1067f1606a.mp4?t=1749060710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\ud83d\udc4aEpic space combat! Defend Frogus against alien invaders! \ud83d\udc7d </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083360/extras/045681d4069a05a74a394898d700698f.avif?t=1749060710\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >________________________________________________________________________________________________________</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span